/docs/opencode-setup.md
/docs/source-backup-review.md

# Local agent configuration, automation state and nested tool worktrees.
# Keep these root-scoped; source, docs, test fixtures and sanitized examples stay eligible.
/.omo/
/.bmad-loop/
/_bmad/
/.agents/
/.claude/
/.opencode/
